menu "hassctrl vibration"

    config HC_VIBRATION
        bool "Vibration motor"
        depends on HC_BOARD_HAS_VIBRATION
        default y
        help
            A vibration motor on a GPIO (hc::board::Info::vibration_gpio): a pulse with every tap
            that clicks, a pattern while the alarm rings, the Vibration switch in Settings, Sound
            and the `vibrate` console command. Only boards with a motor offer it.

endmenu
